  "notes": "{一覧|いちらん} is used for organized lists and summaries, often in written or formal contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {一覧|いちらん}{表|ひょう} (list, table)\n- {一覧|いちらん}する (to look over, to glance through)\n- {料金|りょうきん}{一覧|いちらん} (price list)\n- {商品|しょうひん}{一覧|いちらん} (product list)\n- メニュー{一覧|いちらん} (menu list)\n- {一覧|いちらん}ページ (listing page)\n\nUSAGE:\n- Often used as a suffix attached to another noun: {価格|かかく}{一覧|いちらん} (price list)\n- {一覧|いちらん}する functions as a する verb meaning \"to look over\" or \"to survey,\" though it is quite formal",
